{"games":[{"id":71361406063477,"name":"Transform to Fly Brainrot","desc":"🕊️ Welcome to Transform to Fly Brainrot!\n\n✨ BIG UPDATES EVERY SATURDAY!\n\nHow to Play:\n\n🪽 Fly High: Equip your wings and explore the massive map!\n\n🤪 Transform: Become your favorite Brainrot characters!\n\n🧬 EVO Evolution: Be there when a Legendary EVO spawns! Upgrade your Brainrots to the max—exclusive to this game!\n\n💸 Collect & Level Up: Collect and upgrade your Brainrots to reach higher levels and gain more power!\n\n🏆 Flex Your Rarity: Show off legendary Brainrot forms like the Dragon Cannelloni to the world!\n\n🔄 Rebirth: Rebirth to unlock bigger, better, and more luxurious wings!\n\n🎁 EXTRAS:\n\n⭐ PREMIUM BENEFITS: Get a +10% Cash boost!\n\n👍 JOIN THE GROUP: Like the game and join our group for a special in-game reward!","path":"/game/71361406063477-transform-to-fly-brainrot","slug":"71361406063477-transform-to-fly-brainrot","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e10fb7c15c2094e8adf335830f30b5b48f198a99404e7e73e26f62d055fcc293.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-20e7b008d976334da3613f981db2c6a2/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":3736445,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-15T19:10:20.355Z","creator":{"name":"Jumping Journey","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":16541340872,"name":"Clark County","desc":"The County of Clark is the largest county in the State of Mayflower, home to the busiest and most populous city in the Union of Columbia; the City of Lander.\n\nThe area that is now the County of Clark was settled by colonists hailing from Pax Britannia in December of 1771 as a part of the original 14 colonies as Pax Landeria. Proceeding the end of the revolution against Pax Britannia in July of 1776 and the creation of the Union of Columbia and the State of Mayflower, the County of Clark was created as one of the four original counties of the State of Mayflower.\n\nThe current county seat for the County of Clark is the Town of Mersea. Alongside the county seat, the County of Clark is home to the state seat for the State of Mayflower; the City of Lander.\n\nThis experience is constantly developing and is prone to changes, including shutdowns and the wipe of player data.\n\nThe in-game time period is in the early 2000s.","path":"/game/16541340872-clark-county","slug":"16541340872-clark-county","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6c51779dc32f5daab51af80306dbedd6e85986b7094e676ce2e78118ff6631dd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-83c1c28152000990d8b8cd663edfb613/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":3178687,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-30T19:58:24.662Z","creator":{"name":"State οf Mayflowеr","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":77346301318916,"name":"[✈️] Grow A Car🚗","desc":"🚗 Welcome to Grow a Car!\n\n🤑 Purchase Cars, grow your collection and become the richest player in Grow a Car!\n\n💡 [How To Play]\nPurchase Cars at the Car Shop.\nPlace the Car in your Plot.\nEarn Cash and grow your CAR EMPIRE!\n\n💤 REMEMBER, your Cars will generate Cash OFFLINE!\n\n🔗 Tags: Grow a Garden, Grow, Steal, Car, Vehicle, Tycoon.","path":"/game/77346301318916-grow-a-car","slug":"77346301318916-grow-a-car","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3f0af5cc1677ad43e846f3a957d91ef567d9e946b59fb92cb727444c9397c4ab.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-291db8d45e54ef88343a031b143c212c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":27120298,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-18T15:59:40.880Z","creator":{"name":"0 Thought Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":75528440071743,"name":"[LIVE EVENT] SMASH Walls For Brainrots!","desc":"Welcome to Smash Walls For Brainrots!\n\n👊Smash through walls to discover brainrots!\n🧠Collect brainrots and place them on your plot!\n💸Watch your brainrots earn you cash over time!\n🧤Upgrade your gloves to smash even harder walls!\n🌍Explore new biomes for rarer brainrots!\n\nRemember to like & favorite the game for updates! 👍⭐","path":"/game/75528440071743-smash-walls-for-brainrots","slug":"75528440071743-smash-walls-for-brainrots","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f2de65eef9cc0c42070f91a029a08bf7a0ce5c5624d87b5f08a376134e5d4f5c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b072b7ccd3ed285770a17580d68e9510/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":9544486,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-25T21:03:44.195Z","creator":{"name":"519 Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":72666297062642,"name":"The Odyssey: Defy the Gods","desc":"Defy fate. Sail home.\n\nThe official companion to Christopher Nolan's The Odyssey. A survival sailing adventure across the ancient ocean. Pack a crew, ration your supplies, and appease the gods for the right of safe passage.\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n🪵 Scavenge mysterious islands for food, wood, and lost crew\n🌊Survive crushing storms and whirlpools\n🏛️Solve puzzles on mythic islands for legendary rewards\n⚓Sail with friends\n🗺️A new sea every voyage\n\n ⚠️Ages 18+","path":"/game/72666297062642-the-odyssey-defy-the-gods","slug":"72666297062642-the-odyssey-defy-the-gods","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b58ef63bd4cc5a2bedc623986289a45c61fa340b4feaa95f48649ed50acc53bc.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f432b8d62e5a45747fcb50f0733d1b15/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":3109224,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-02T11:26:49.859Z","creator":{"name":"The Odyssey Movie","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":18528820416,"name":"[UPD] Toilet Eating Simulator","desc":"🏋️ Eat Food To Gain Power & Evolve!\n🥊 Fight Others and Become Strongest!\n🏆 Collect All Pets!\n\n🔥 USE THE CODE 'RELEASE' & '500 Likes' AND LIKE THE GAME FOR A FREE IN-GAME BOOST! \n👍 NEW CODE RELEASES ONCE THE GA